# Shell scripts must keep LF endings. A CRLF in the shebang of
# docker-entrypoint.sh makes Linux fail with "no such file or directory" for a
# file that is plainly there, which is a miserable thing to debug inside a
# container. The Ocean sample repo ships this same rule for the same reason.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
.dockerignore text eol=lf
